the original six-color Apple logo.", "identifier": "components-tab-views-thumbnail.png", "type": "image", "variants": [{"traits": ["2x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/components-tab-views-thumbnail@2x.png"}, {"traits": ["2x", "dark"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/components-tab-views-thumbnail~dark@2x.png"}]}, "components.png": {"alt": "", "identifier": "components.png", "type": "image", "variants": [{"traits": ["2x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/components@2x.png"}, {"traits": ["2x", "dark"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/components~dark@2x.png"}]}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/boxes": {"abstract": [{"text": "A box creates a visually distinct group of logically related information and components.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/boxes", "images": [{"identifier": "components-boxes-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Boxes", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/boxes"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/collections": {"abstract": [{"text": "A collection manages an ordered set of content and presents it in a customizable and highly visual layout.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/collections", "images": [{"identifier": "components-collections-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Collections", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/collections"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/column-views": {"abstract": [{"text": "A column view \u2014 also called a ", "type": "text"}, {"inlineContent": [{"text": "browser", "type": "text"}], "type": "emphasis"}, {"text": " \u2014 lets people view and navigate a data hierarchy using a series of vertical columns.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/column-views", "images": [{"identifier": "components-column-views-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Column views", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/column-views"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/components": {"abstract": [{"text": "Learn how to use and customize system-defined components to give people a familiar and consistent experience.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/components", "images": [{"identifier": "overview.svg", "type": "icon"}, {"identifier": "components.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "collectionGroup", "title": "Components", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/components"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/disclosure-controls": {"abstract": [{"text": "Disclosure controls reveal and hide information and functionality related to specific controls or views.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/disclosure-controls", "images": [{"identifier": "components-disclosure-controls-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Disclosure controls", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/disclosure-controls"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/labels": {"abstract": [{"text": "A label is a static piece of text that people can read and often copy, but not edit.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/labels", "images": [{"identifier": "components-labels-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Labels", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/labels"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/lists-and-tables": {"abstract": [{"text": "Lists and tables present data in one or more columns of rows.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/lists-and-tables", "images": [{"identifier": "components-lists-and-tables-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Lists and tables", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/lists-and-tables"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/lockups": {"abstract": [{"text": "Lockups combine multiple separate views into a single, interactive unit.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/lockups", "images": [{"identifier": "components-lockups-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Lockups", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/lockups"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/outline-views": {"abstract": [{"text": "An outline view presents hierarchical data in a scrolling list of cells that are organized into columns and rows.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/outline-views", "images": [{"identifier": "components-outline-views-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Outline views", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/outline-views"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/split-views": {"abstract": [{"text": "A split view manages the presentation of multiple adjacent panes of content, each of which can contain a variety of components, including tables, collections, images, and custom views.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/split-views", "images": [{"identifier": "components-split-views-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Split views", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/split-views"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/tab-views": {"abstract": [{"text": "A tab view presents multiple mutually exclusive panes of content in the same area, which people can switch between using a tabbed control.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/tab-views", "images": [{"identifier": "components-tab-views-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "article", "title": "Tab views", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines/tab-views"}, "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/human-interface-guidelines": {"abstract": [{"text": "The HIG contains guidance and best practices that can help you design a", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "great experience for any Apple platform.", "type": "text"}], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/human-interface-guidelines", "images": [{"identifier": "human-interface-guidelines-page-image-card.png", "type": "card"}], "kind": "article", "role": "collection", "title": "Human Interface Guidelines", "type": "topic", "url": "/design/human-interface-guidelines"}, "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/technologies": {"abstract": [], "identifier": "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/technologies", "kind": "technologies", "role": "overview", "title": "Technologies", "type": "topic", "url": "/documentation/technologies"}, "human-interface-guidelines-page-image-card.png": {"alt": "An illustration of several Liquid Glass components such as toggles, sliders, and buttons, atop a neutral background. The transparent components cast shadows on the background and allow their colored elements, like a blue slider track and a green toggle backing, to show through, highlighting the Liquid Glass material's lensing effect.", "identifier": "human-interface-guidelines-page-image-card.png", "type": "image", "variants": [{"traits": ["2x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/human-interface-guidelines-page-image-card@2x.png"}]}, "layout-and-organization.svg": {"alt": "An icon of a window that's divided into three areas: a toolbar above two side-by-side views, suggesting layout and organization.", "identifier": "layout-and-organization.svg", "type": "image", "variants": [{"svgID": "layout-and-organization", "traits": ["1x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/layout-and-organization.svg"}]}, "overview.svg": {"alt": "An icon of a grid comprised of four squares.", "identifier": "overview.svg", "type": "image", "variants": [{"svgID": "overview", "traits": ["1x", "light"], "url": "/images/com.apple.HIG/overview.svg"}]}}}